        <p class="eyebrow">The voyage</p>
        <h2>An unforgettable voyage 30 minutes from Lima</h2>
        <div class="prose" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
          <p><strong>ECOCRUCEROS</strong> invites you on a 3.5-hour voyage just 30 minutes from central Lima, aboard a comfortable, safe cruiser yacht with sophisticated navigation gear, an experienced crew and restrooms on board.</p>
          <p>It's one of Lima's most enjoyable tours: a spectacular natural show of cold-sea seabirds and thousands of sea lions — which you can swim with in their habitat.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

