<section class="section">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <div class="media-split media-split--reverse">
      <div class="media-split__media">
        <img src="/assets/img/galeria/g9.jpg" alt="Sea-lion colony at the Palomino Islands, Callao">
        <span class="media-split__badge">5,000–8,000 sea lions</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Palomino Islands</p>
        <h2>A natural sanctuary in the Callao sea</h2>
        <p class="lead">A group of islands behind San Lorenzo Island, home to 5,000–8,000 sea lions. The area offers many advantages:</p>
        <ul class="checklist" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
          <li>A significant number of sea lions all year round.</li>
          <li>Close to Lima: Callao is 30 minutes from the capital.</li>
          <li>A voyage rich in history and ecology.</li>
          <li>The chance to swim with the sea lions.</li>
          <li>Seabirds such as pelicans, boobies, Inca terns and Humboldt penguins.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container reveal">
