          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="stack">
        <p><strong>Daily departures by reservation.</strong> We arrange availability and your group's time on WhatsApp.</p>
        <p>The route includes a <strong>stop to swim with the sea lions</strong>. Halfway through the return trip we serve cold and hot (non-alcoholic) drinks and snacks, <strong>unlimited</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
