<!-- Swim with sea lions -->
<section class="section section--sky" id="nadar">
  <div class="container reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">The experience</p>
    <h2>Swim with the sea lions</h2>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6);align-items:center">
      <div class="stack">
        <p>At the Palomino Islands, after circling the islands and watching the sea lions, we offer you the option to <strong>swim with them</strong> in their natural habitat.</p>
        <p>The yacht's lower deck is freed up for those who want to get in the water: it has <strong>2 cabins, 2 restrooms and a lounge</strong> to change in, plus a <strong>hose shower</strong> to rinse off.</p>
        <p><strong>No swimming ability required:</strong> you enter the sea wearing a life vest and accompanied at all times by our crew.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:520px;margin-inline:auto;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-2);background:#000">
